    "detailed_description": "A game of cute, pudgy butts!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;HIP GAME&quot; is a puzzle game in which you have to connect the same buttocks of the demon girls so that they do not overflow from the box.<br />\r\nEach time you connect two of the demon girls' butts, they will evolve into a different species!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBy evolving them in succession in a single fall, you can increase your score by connecting combos.<br />\r\nAim for a high score with consecutive evolutions!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the collection, you can see the butts that you have evolved.<br />\r\nLet's collect the butts of slime girls, succubus girls, and other unusual monster girls by connecting many of them together!",
